{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>此離線閱讀工具適合經常收藏文章、希望在通勤或旅行時無網絡閱讀的讀者；可從 Safari 或其他應用程式一鍵儲存內容，並以簡潔版面閱讀。現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-135.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線閱讀與摘要</h2>\n<p>可從 Safari 或其他應用程式一鍵儲存文章，並在任何地方離線閱讀；內建 AI 摘要、重點整理與問答功能，協助快速理解長文。支援劃線、筆記、文字轉語音與背景播放，亦可全文搜尋、篩選及整理收藏。所有內容以本機儲存，無廣告、無追蹤，並可隨時匯出或刪除資料。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-401-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-402-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-403-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-404-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-405-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-406-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Read Later Offline : CACHE</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"http